"P1547837087" "The antidote"
// DetailString :
"P681588423" "This antidote was developed to combat a biological weapon that Arachnos is testing in Paragon City. You had to take down a Longbow hero to get it but, hey, them's the breaks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3272077155" "{VillainName}. I've learned of the most exciting caper! It seems Arachnos has developed a biological weapon. Silly devils, they tried deploying it in Paragon City. As we speak, several citizens of Kings Row are experiencing the first symptoms of a disease that should kill within twenty-four hours. Oh, they've got their doctors working on it. Might even come up with a solution. But in the meantime, we've got the opportunity of a lifetime! <br><br>Arachnos, naturally, developed a cure for the weapon. And Longbow, naturally, dispatched a hero to recover it. Here's where you step in. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Steal that antidote and let Longbow take the blame!</A> I'll pay you well for a prize such as this!"
// AcceptString :
"P679152732" "Steal the antidote"
// SendOffString :
"P3605057443" "You'll have to defeat every Arachnos soldier to ensure Longbow takes the blame for the theft. My brain is just spinning with the possibilities for such a unique find!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4154026085" "Defeat all Arachnos & Longbow"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2567205731" "Do you have that antidote?"

