"P3903233741" "You stole these green and purple chemical concoctions from one of the Facemaker's labs. They're offensive to the nose, but they ought to be quite pleasing to the perennially curious Dr. Percey."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1677610974" "I'm sure you've heard of a most accomplished young lady known as the Facemaker? She's a disciple of Vahzilok, and is well known for her habit of carving up innocent young debutantes for her own private collection of parts. Yes, yes, deplorable. Nevertheless, I'd like to know more about her processes. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to go to a Vahzilok lair and return with samples of the Facemaker's reanimation chemicals.</A> I'll reward you well for your efforts."
// AcceptString :
"P3371009809" "Get samples of the Facemaker's chemicals"
// SendOffString :
"P1448482060" "I have to admit, the Facemaker has long been a subject of my study. Her work is remarkable. Her students, however, scare me. Make sure to eliminate any on scene to keep them from following you back to me."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1570175618" "Fight disciples & get chemicals"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P858496715" "I really want those chemicals, {VillainName}. And I want to feel safe while I examine them. Don't fail me."
// TaskTitle :
"P2652218458" "Steal Facemaker's Reanimation Chemicals"

