// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL2.5_Percey_Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P721857961" "My sources have brought me news of a fascinating development. As I'm sure you know, the Lost spread by encouraging new recruits to take some sort of drug, commonly referred to as 'Shift.' It alters their physical and mental structure, and gives them their strange powers. Recently, however, it seems they've taken their movement to the next level. Rumors of a single infectious Lost have been spreading throughout Cap au Diable. A Lost Typhoid Mary, if you please. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to capture this infectious Lost.</A> I want to study him."
// AcceptString :
"P575951557" "Capture the infectious Lost"
// SendOffString :
"P4133429046" "This individual may well open up whole new arenas in the world of super-powered physiology."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3283345295" "Defeat Typhoid Willy & friends"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3759649892" "I have a room all prepared for our guest. Please see that he's in it shortly."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3983013593" "You hear a voice cry, 'And the change will wash over the world!'"

